# Bin 0 only: a tiny disk and bulge rate whose output is subnormal, where the left-to-right
# conversion (W:945-946) and one combined factor round to different floats; and a metallicity
# whose float (metals / gas) / 10 differs from metals / (gas * 10) (W:949). Constructed rounding-
# point fixture: a one-rounding difference in the expression it names reaches a float store, so a
# port that fuses, splits or regroups it differently fails here.
